{"errno":0,"data":{"id":109,"categoryId1":16,"categoryId2":17,"categoryId3":1615,"categorynewId1":75,"categorynewName1":null,"categorynewName2":"Commercial Vehicle / Mobile Natural Gas","categorynewId2":119,"productName":"CI-4 Diesel Engine Oil Package","productCode":"","status":1,"content":"<p style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: Arial, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, STHeiti, SimSun, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">RF6078 CI-4 Diesel Engine Oil Package is formulated with a number of detergent, dispersant, ZDDP and other additive components. Diesel engine oils blended with this package provide excellent high-temp detergency, soot dispersancy and anti-oxidation and corrosion resistance performance.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: Arial, &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, STHeiti, SimSun, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">15W-40 diesel engine oil formulated with th